<title>AUSTRALIA: Broker DMG buys 3.5 pct of Burns Philp.</title>
<headline>Broker DMG buys 3.5 pct of Burns Philp.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stock brokers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (DMG) on Wednesday bought over 3.5 percent of the issued capital in Burns Philp &amp; Co Ltd at A$2.50 per share, paying about A$47.5 million, brokers said.</p>
<p>Brokers said DMG bought about 19 million Burns Philp shares. Burns Philp shares closed one cent weaker at A$2.37.</p>
</text>
